A '''pet store'''<ref name="SC2AD" /> was located in the [[pirate market]]<ref name="EG">{{SW|url=series/skeleton-crew/season-1-episode-2-episode-guide|text="Way, Way Out Past the Barrier" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars: Skeleton Crew}}</ref> in [[Borgo Prime|Port Borgo]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="SC2">{{SkeletonCrew|Way, Way Out Past the Barrier}}</ref> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> the [[Youngling|child]] [[KB]] look at a [[Fuzzball (species)|fuzzball]] caged in the shop as well as a case containing aquatic creatures<ref name="SC2" /> that looked like a cross between a [[jellyfish]] and a [[squid]].<ref name="SC2AD" /> The [[Theelin]] [[Melna]] then pulled KB and her friend [[Fern]] into the store's kiosk, crouching down behind the counter and warning the children they were not safe in Port Borgo as it was full of [[pirate]]s.<ref name="SC2" />

